# Optional: export browser cookies for YouTube/Facebook/Instagram on VPS servers.
# 1. Install a browser extension like "Get cookies.txt LOCALLY"
# 2. Log in to YouTube/Facebook in your browser
# 3. Export cookies for those sites
# 4. Save as cookies.txt in the backend folder (or mount at /app/cookies.txt in Docker)
# 5. Redeploy the backend
#
# Netscape HTTP Cookie File format is required.
